{{Politics of Balisca}}

The '''Commissar of the Castejón Metropolis''' is the rotating facilitator for the [[Metropolitan Council of Castejón]]. The officeholder acts as the ''[[W:Primus inter pares|primus inter pares]]'' of the Council's delegates, and is responsible for facilitating meetings of community assemblies, councils, or other collective decision-making bodies. Lacking any executive powers (such as those of a [[W:Mayor|mayor]]), the role is only for practical purposes – organizing the agenda, ensuring delegates (and thus their [[Commune district|districts]]) have a chance to be heard, keeping discussions on track, and [[W:Minutes|summarizing points]].

The current Commissar, [[Siyaad Yussuf]], representing [[Andújar (commune district)|Andújar]], began his term on 3 December 2024.

